message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "aksvm: Associated-kernel support vector machines"
abstract: >-
  Python package turning associated kernels (Beta, Gamma, Poisson, binomial,
  discrete triangular, Conway-Maxwell-Poisson) into positive semi-definite
  probability-product kernels for support vector machines on heterogeneous data.
